      P1/S10 facade fallbacks + interpolation (selectAllLabel / counts / group+leaf a11y / summary /
      checkbox + expansion a11y values).

  PARITY NOTE (web semantics reproduced exactly, incl. the subtle one): the TOP-LEVEL select-all
  (`allVisibleSelected`) tests EVERY visible leaf INCLUDING disabled ones (web `visibleLeafIds.every`),
  whereas the GROUP tri-state (`allGroupSelected`) tests only the ENABLED leaves
  (web `visibleEnabledLeaves.every`). Both are implemented and asserted as the web behaves.

  STATE PARITY: the web source's real branches are reproduced in full — `loading` (skeleton body),
  `empty` (no groups), `noResults` (search filtered everything out), and `populated`. The generic
  template's `error` / `stale` / `offline` states do NOT exist in this CONTROLLED PRESENTATIONAL primitive
